# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): a sound carries its Tuning (ledger 3, Evan 2026-11-08). Drone I on
# D3, drone II on A3, Wander (par78) on its minor pentatonic, a little Pitch glide; stored in A1 on LMY (par110 7),
# then the Tuning set back to 12-tone (0) and Wander heard there; A1 tapped (Scene time 1.1 s, par71 24): LMY comes
# back with it, half way through the glide; then P1 Niagara, which names no Tuning: 12-tone again. The Setup 2 page
# after A1. Not a test of its own (no expectations; tests/scenarios/tuning.omni has them).
notips
set 74 0
set 51 0
set 71 24
set 0 5000
set 21 5700
set 50 25
set 81 0
set 78 85
press SEL
tapkey w8
release SEL
tap PLAY
wait 1500
set 110 7
press SAVE
tapkey w0
release SAVE
wait 300
set 110 0
wav sound-tuning.wav
wait 8000
tapkey w0
wait 8000
tap GLO
tap GLO
wait 300
shot sound-tuning-setup.png
tap HOME
press SEL
tapkey w14
release SEL
tapkey w0
wait 6000
wavstop
